sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant L as Ledger
    participant S as Specialist
    O->>L: get_completed(key)
    L-->>O: miss
    O->>L: reserve(key)
    L-->>O: pending
    O->>S: delegate
    S-->>O: result
    O->>L: complete(key,result)
    Note over O: crash after complete
    O->>L: get_completed(key)
    L-->>O: result
    Note over O: no second specialist call
